  "logic": "All31 selected concrete plan records are sealed and directly derive from ActionPlan, so switch type patterns cannot steal another target or accept a subclass. Decoder order/cast/planner arguments/defaults/check dispatch exact. ?? remains lazy: same-type existing plan reused; null/wrong-type triggers exact planner. Null planner result matches switch fallbackfalse, corresponding to original null guard/removal; unknown decoder fallthrough continues untouched.",
  "limits": "Read-only source review only; no build/test/GitHub write/claim performed; root owns overall caller/loop checks."
}